{"rank": 398, "root": "نصر", "form": 8, "lemma": "انتَصَرَ", "count": 7, "ayahCount": 7, "share": 0.04, "meaning": {"bs": "pobijediti, odbraniti se", "en": "to win, to defend oneself", "tr": "galip gelmek, kendini savunmak", "fr": "vaincre, se défendre", "id": "menang, membela diri", "ur": "بدلہ لینا، اپنا دفاع کرنا", "bn": "জয়ী হওয়া, আত্মরক্ষা করা", "fa": "پیروز شدن، از خود دفاع کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/3bdb70350a4db67e2590.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-vnsr_8\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes vnsr_8-0{from{transform:translateY(36px)}}@keyframes vnsr_8-1{from{transform:rotate(0deg)}}.va-vnsr_8 .fg{animation:vnsr_8-0 1s ease-in-out both}.va-vnsr_8 .ra{transform:rotate(-135deg);animation:vnsr_8-1 0.5s ease-in-out 0.9s both}.va-vnsr_8 .la{transform:rotate(135deg);animation:vnsr_8-1 0.5s ease-in-out 0.9s both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-vnsr_8.off,.va-vnsr_8.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-vnsr_8,.va-vnsr_8 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"p\" d=\"M80 61V12\"/><path class=\"q fg\" d=\"M80 12l14 5-14 5z\"/><g transform=\"translate(56 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "ٱنتَصَرَ", "plain": "اِنْتَصَرَ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/3bdb70350a4db67e2590.m4a", "recited": "audio/114d8e6